This repository is the public source for the modified plugin that ships inside the
Roach Coach apps (iOS and Android). It is maintained by Cameron Aldinger (Roach Coach).
Source code: https://github.com/caldinger/capacitor-social-login (branch: roachcoach)

MODIFICATIONS:

Facebook Login has been removed. All Facebook SDK dependencies and code have been
removed from iOS and Android. Google Sign-In and Apple Sign-In are preserved unchanged.

Modified files (compared with upstream 8.3.38):
- Package.swift: Removed the facebook-ios-sdk dependency and the FacebookCore and FacebookLogin products
- CapgoCapacitorSocialLogin.podspec: Removed FBSDKCoreKit and FBSDKLoginKit dependencies, Alamofire preserved for Apple Sign-In
- android/build.gradle: Removed facebook-login dependency, removed includeFacebook ext variable, removed Twitter dependency variables, always use the facebookDisabled source set
- android/gradle.properties: Generated provider flags with Apple and Google enabled, Facebook disabled
- ios/Sources/SocialLoginPlugin/FacebookProvider.swift: Replaced with a stub that rejects all calls
- ios/Sources/SocialLoginPlugin/SocialLoginPlugin.swift: Removed conditional Facebook imports, always uses the stub FacebookProvider
- package.json: Stripped devDependencies, removed build scripts, removed facebookEnabled from the files list, removed twitter and facebook from keywords
- android/src/facebookEnabled/: Deleted directory (FacebookProvider.java)
- NOTICE: Added (this file)
- README.md: Added a note at the top describing this fork

The six source files above that can carry comments (Package.swift, the podspec,
android/build.gradle, android/gradle.properties, FacebookProvider.swift,
SocialLoginPlugin.swift) also carry an "SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0" line.

